{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07283","headline":"长沙早春雪後临湘水呈同游诸子 · 刘长卿","name":"长沙早春雪後临湘水呈同游诸子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汀洲暖渐渌，烟景淡相和。\n举目方如此，归心岂奈何。\n日华浮野雪，春色染湘波。\n北渚生芳草，东风变旧柯。\n江山古思远，猨鸟暮情多。\n君问渔人意，沧浪自有歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}